[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429630\">7045B15</a></p><p>1. Release the cover (1a) from the retainers (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2053011.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Remove the  trim.</p><p>2. Keep the unwoven cloth (TNT).</p><p>3. If necessary, remove the padding.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2053012.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the cover is undamaged.</p><p>Position the unwoven cloth (TNT) and cover\ntaking care to fit it perfectly on the upholstery.</p><p>Engage the retainers.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429630\">7045B15</a></p>"]]